; Isolated conformance executable for the DEFAULT implementation of the
; virtual tn_crypto library. This stanza deliberately names NO concrete
; implementation: with only tn_crypto in scope, dune falls back to
; default_implementation (telcoin_ocaml.crypto_stub, lib/crypto/dune), so
; this executable proves both that the fallback still engages while the
; real implementation coexists in the repo and that the stub satisfies
; the same shared conformance functor. The pre-existing test/dune and
; bin/dune stanzas are untouched.
(test
 (name test_crypto_stub_conformance)
 (libraries tn_crypto crypto_conformance alcotest))
